<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9bff2ffb">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product identifies the gaps in skills, capabilities, and knowledge between how the impacted audiences
    currently perform their roles and how they will be expected to perform in the future. In larger projects, two needs
    analyses may need to be completed: a high-level one giving an indication of learning needs per team, and a more
    detailed one later in the project.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="3d708a0b"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="84108cf4"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="d962dd34"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="9f791c9e">&lt;p&gt;
    To document learning requirements for a project or program and inform the development of a comprehensive learning
    solution. It provides a comprehensive understanding of the learning requirements of impacted audiences. Through an
    analysis of skill, capability, and knowledge gaps, the needs analysis
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="6d0a2964"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="c4890353"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="7b185e8b">&lt;p&gt;
    A high-level needs analysis typically captures:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Impacted business areas and teams
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Systems impacts
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Type of competencies required
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Learning course titles and overview of course content
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Courses mapped to teams
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        High-level business resource requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        High-level technical requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    A detailed needs analysis typically captures:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Impacted business areas, teams, roles and end user numbers
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Systems impacts refined
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Type of competencies required refined
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Learning course titles, confirmed content, method of delivery and course duration
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Courses mapped to roles
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirmed business resource requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirmed technical requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Course curriculum per role
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Learning calendar
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
